# MASTER BUILD PROMPT — DEVSTORE
## Full-Scale International Multi-Vendor E-Commerce Marketplace

Act as a senior software architect, principal full-stack engineer, UI/UX designer, database architect, security engineer and QA engineer.

Your task is to design and build **DevStore**, a production-oriented, full-stack, international multi-vendor e-commerce marketplace supporting physical and digital products.

This is not a landing-page project, a static prototype or a simple shopping cart. It is a complete marketplace application with distinct customer, vendor and administrator experiences.

Build a scalable, modular, secure application with functional features, persistent data, real authentication, proper authorization, server-side business logic and a deployment-ready architecture.

